ValidateInstrModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Validates an IR instruction: op must carry the "IR." prefix and contain no forbidden tokens (HasForbidden), args — a list, each operand valid via ValidateOperand. Returns 1 on success.
    Provides: ValidateInstr(instr) -> ok.
    DependsOn: HasForbidden, ValidateOperand.
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../ValidateInstr/ValidateInstr.sir).
